description: ML training and serving pipeline rules
globs: services/ml/app/{features,models,backtest}/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Pipelines
- Use `sklearn.pipeline.Pipeline` / `ColumnTransformer`; no manual train/test preprocessing duplication.
- Fit ONLY on train fold; transform on val/test. Enforced in code review.
- Feature functions are pure: `(df_in) -> df_out`; no global state.

# Training hygiene
- Record the important context for model runs: parameters, metrics, dataset assumptions, and produced artifacts.
- Start simple. Use heavier experiment tracking only when model work becomes active enough to justify it.

# Serving
- Keep model-loading behavior explicit and inspectable.
- Optimize model format or serving path only when latency or deployment constraints justify the extra complexity.
- Never load untrusted pickles from user input.
